--- !u!114 &132246256
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 132246251}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 37171f0ed2d9d3f49b2194e5c650a179, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcDialoguePanel: {fileID: 1587397415}
  npcDialogueText: {fileID: 738903753}
  playerDialoguePanel: {fileID: 1205201307}
  playerDialogueText: {fileID: 917671534}
  dialogue:
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Hey, Alice, I\u2019ve been wondering... who exactly is Milady? I\u2019ve
      never seen her portrait or even a family picture of hers."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "I\u2019m really curious about how she and her sister looked, especially
      since one of the notes mentioned she has a sibling."
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: ' Milady was known to be kind and gentle, while her sister was energetic
      and outgoing. They both had long, silky hair.'
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "But here\u2019s the thing\u2014almost no one knows she had a sister. Even
      I don\u2019t like talking about it."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: What do you mean by that? Is it some sort of secret?
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: You could say that. Mister, did you realize that hardly anyone mentions
      or knows about Milady having a sister?
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Yeah, I noticed. Most of the notes left by previous visitors only ever
      talk about the Hayes family having three members.
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "It\u2019s a mystery I\u2019ve been trying to solve myself, but it\u2019s
      challenging when I\u2019m constantly being watched from the shadows."
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "I think it\u2019s best if we stop this conversation here. The rest is
      up to you to uncover."
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: This is as much of a clue as I can give you for now.
  npcContButton: {fileID: 492028864}
  playerContButton: {fileID: 1360566475}
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  playerMovement: {fileID: 731261279}
  inventoryButton: {fileID: 0}
  pauseButton: {fileID: 1346257381}
