      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Beware of the <color=#FF0000>shadows</color> lurking in the dark corners,
    for they appear without warning, creeping up on you when you least expect it.
    They might seem slow at first, but don\u2019t be fooled\u2014they can close the
    distance in an instant. However, there\u2019s a way to avoid them: find safe
    zones, areas bathed in light. The shadows cannot follow you there; it\u2019s
    your only sanctuary.\n\nAnd remember this\u2014trust no one you encounter here.
    Not everyone is who they seem, and appearances can be deceiving."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79af5aa2d9f81be4080184a80363fcfc, type: 2}
