--- !u!114 &731261274
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 731261273}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f13ca54006115e24bb77c1d39ff869a0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcDialoguePanel: {fileID: 1278757614}
  npcDialogueText: {fileID: 873914673}
  playerDialoguePanel: {fileID: 769399963}
  playerDialogueText: {fileID: 1381123546}
  dialogue:
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: This floor feels different... almost like a long corridor.
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: This is the secret area of the Hayes family's note keeper.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: A secret place? Really?
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: Yes. Have you noticed? Every time you use a door or gate, it teleports
      you to a random floor.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Now that you mention it, the teleportation has sent us to all sorts of
      places.
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: If you possess a specific item, you can control where you end up. But,
      there are times when the teleportation malfunctions, and it can separate people.
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: So you need to be prepared when that happens.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: I see. You seem to know a lot about this... How did you even get all this
      information?
  - speaker: Cecilia
    line: "That\u2019s a secret."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Hmm... (She seems suspicious, but her expression is calm and untroubled.)
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Alright, I won\u2019t press you further. Everyone has their secrets."
  npcContButton: {fileID: 242126422}
  playerContButton: {fileID: 565608312}
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  playerMovement: {fileID: 731261279}
  isTyping: 0
  inventoryButton: {fileID: 0}
  pauseButton: {fileID: 1346257381}
