--- !u!114 &822454684
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 822454682}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7da76348f51840f44b66e5c73f635a15, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 1413022940}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1132912632}
  dialogueLines:
  - "Let\u2019s see what this entry says..."
  - '"Currently, only one Note Keeper remains, as the others have been hunted down."'
  - "There\u2019s no clear reason given for why they were targeted, but it says the
    surviving Note Keeper must do whatever it takes to preserve the history of the
    Hayes family."
  - Hmm... So the Note Keeper left this message saying they were hunted, and now
    only one remains.
  - Yet, no one knows who the Note Keepers actually were. Their identities are completely
    concealed, known only to those closest to the Hayes family.
  - "Who would want to kill the Note Keepers? Could it be because they\u2019re unaffected
    by the curse that Elana mentioned?"
  - I need to keep searching for more clues... There's definitely something deeper
    going on here.
  wordSpeed: 0.05
