  m_text: In the 1970s, the Hayes family hosted a grand gathering, a prestigious
    event aimed at showcasing their collection of rare antiques. The room was filled
    with awe-struck guests, but among the impressive display of over ten priceless
    items, two particular antiques stood out. Their intricate design and uniqueness
    captured the attention of everyone present, sparking heated discussions and fascination
    throughout the evening.
