  m_text: 'List of Antique:


    1. <s>Grandfather Clock</s>

    2. <s>Victorian
    Oil Lamp</s>

    3. <s>Vintage Globe</s>

    4. <s>Hand-carved Chest </s>

    5.
    <s>Ornate Mirror</s>

    6. <s>Porcelain Dolls</s>

    7. <s>Antique Typewriter</s>

    8.
    Old Phonograph'
